    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01938",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“失礼啦。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Excuse me.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01938",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "（小姐的衣裳蛮雅致的，脸部表情似乎觉得冷。）",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The young lady's clothes were quite elegant, and the expression on her face made her seem cold.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01938",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "夫人点燃煤气炉子。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The lady lit the gas stove.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01938",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "（红茶凉了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The black tea had gone cold.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01938",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "这小姐怎么沉默不吭声呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Why was this young lady sitting there in silence without saying a word?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01938",
      "unit_index": 6,
      "source_text": "真不好办呀。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This was really awkward.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01938",
      "unit_index": 7,
      "source_text": "要不然就让狗店老板把狗牵到院子里去？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Or should she have the dog-shop owner take the dog out into the yard?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01938",
      "unit_index": 8,
      "source_text": "院子里晒的是些什么衣物？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What kind of clothes were those drying in the yard?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01938",
      "unit_index": 9,
      "source_text": "点心呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "And what about the sweets?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01938",
      "unit_index": 10,
      "source_text": "这位小姐是否以为付了钱就可以装模作样呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Did this young lady think that paying money gave her the right to put on airs?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01938",
      "unit_index": 11,
      "source_text": "这小姐不是觉着冷，准是因为没向她寒暄。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This young lady was not feeling cold; it must be because no one had greeted her properly.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01938",
      "unit_index": 12,
      "source_text": "这不是什么好狗。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This was not such a fine dog.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01938",
      "unit_index": 13,
      "source_text": "嗨！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Oh!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01938",
      "unit_index": 14,
      "source_text": "赞美她什么地方呢？",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "What part of her should she praise?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01938",
      "unit_index": 15,
      "source_text": "对了对了，好长时间没抱怨女佣用煤气炉子的方法了。）",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Yes, that was it; it had been a long time since she had complained about the maid's way of using the gas stove.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "izu-no-odori-p01938",
      "unit_index": 16,
      "source_text": "夫人在煤气炉前站起身来。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "The lady rose to her feet in front of the gas stove.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
